" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> is true, and false only when both are\nfalse.</li>\n</ul>","file":"ch00-foundations/01-logic.html"}